<v Duki>[笑声]

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:45.960
<v Ira Glass>They're just like Tom Cruise, yes. Yeah. Now, Duki, I was talking to Danielle for our radio program and had her come on and talk about you a little bit. And one of the things that she said was that when she was younger, in order to discipline her, if she was doing something that you didn't like, you could pretty much control her with something called "nose squeaks."
<v Ira Glass>他们就像汤姆·克鲁斯一样，是的。好了，杜基，我为了我们的广播节目和丹妮尔聊过天，让她上节目谈谈你。她说的一件事是，当她还小的时候，为了管教她，如果她做了什么你不喜欢的事，你基本可以通过一种叫“鼻子吱吱声”的东西来控制她。

00:17:45.960 --> 00:18:01.050
<v Duki>Yeah. Because she has this kind of-- it's a prominent nose, you know what I mean? It kind of sticks out. And you just want to squeak it. Like over Thanksgiving, we were watching The Muppet Show, and Miss Piggy was on. And she reminded me  a lot of Nielly.
